<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust ups China Light warrants.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust ups China Light warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said it intended to increase the issue size of its existing 58 million call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd by 30 million warrants.</p>
<p>The existing warrants are listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on October 24.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$30.70</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.96</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	08.OCT.98</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
